      "content": "thanks... that sounds like a good start. but i'm worried about just seeing *when* it happens. i really need to know if it's coming from *him*. \n\nif we can get the logs, can we also look for any metadata that might reveal a device ID or an IP address? i know he's pretty tech-savvy, so he's probably using a VPN or something to hide, but maybe there's a signature or a specific way the command is being formatted that's unique to his old phone or laptop? i just need enough proof so i can actually confront him or tell the police. what should i look for specifically in those logs to link it back to his devices?",
